to be careful what you wish for.<br><br>Now, Jessica is faced with a hard decision. Because changing her past and making herself happy for once could destroy everything she holds dear…<br><br>This hilarious and uplifting book club novel makes you feel like you’re watching a Richard Curtis film. Perfect for fans of David Nicholls, Amanda Prowse and Jojo Moyes.<br><br>_________________________<br><br>Previously published as BY THIS TIME TOMORROW<br><br>‘Hilarious, heartbreaking and unputdownable’ DEBBIE JOHNSON<br><br>‘Warm, funny and hugely relatable’ FIONA GIBSON<br><br>_________________________<br><br>Readers love One More Yesterday!<br><br>‘A wonderful read, full of humour, love and angst’<br><br>‘A great cast of characters who are as likeable as they are funny, a story that has that real feel-good factor’<br><br>‘Full of heart’<br><br>‘Read this book. You too will love it’<br><br>‘An amazing story from the first page until the last’<br><br>‘Engaging, emotional and entertaining’","image":"https://prod-bb-images.akamaized.net/book-covers/coverimage-9780008769789-harpercollinsuk-2025-04-02t08-02.jpg?w=400","author":"Charlotte Butterfield","shareurl":"https://www.bookbeat.com/de/book/1568919","grade":4.3,"language":"English","audiobookisbn":"9780008769789","ebookisbn":null,"published":"2025-04-10T00:00:00+00:00","contenttypetags":["unabridged"],"audiobooksinglesale":null,"ebooksinglesale":null,"series":null,"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://edge.bookbeat.com/api/books/49/1568919","method":"GET"},"nextcontent":{"href":"https://api.bookbeat.com/api/nextcontentviews/1568919","method":"GET"}},"topbadges":[],"_embedded":{"contributors":[{"id":85934,"displayname":"Charlotte Butterfield","role":"bb-author","booksurl":"https://search-api.bookbeat.com/api/appsearch/books?query=*&offset=0&limit=50&market=49&author=Charlotte%20Butterfield&v=20"},{"id":28588,"displayname":"Nicky Diss","role":"bb-narrator","booksurl":"https://search-api.bookbeat.com/api/appsearch?query=*&offset=0&limit=50&market=49&narrator=Nicky%20Diss&v=20"},{"id":50340,"displayname":"Drew Dillon","role":"bb-narrator","booksurl":"https://search-api.bookbeat.com/api/appsearch?query=*&offset=0&limit=50&market=49&narrator=Drew%20Dillon&v=20"}]}},{"id":1581630,"title":"The Family Fix","description":"★ A heartwarming and hilarious novel about family secrets, perfect for fans of Mhairi McFarlane and Debbie Johnson★Three generations. Three secrets. One chance to bring their family closer than ever.<br><br>‘I laughed and shed more than a few tears… One of the best books I’ve read in ages’ FIONA LUCAS<br><br>*THE TIMES BOOK OF THE MONTH*<br><br>*A TIMES POPULAR FICTION BOOK OF THE YEAR*<br><br>_________________________<br><br>Stella’s life hasn’t quite gone to plan. She imagined that, at forty, she’d be settled with a supportive husband, two kids and a dog. Instead, she’s single and living at home with her mum, Bonnie, and grandmother, Florence. She passes the evenings in her childhood bedroom, obsessively searching for the perfect sperm donor.<br><br>Unbeknownst to Stella is that Bonnie and Florence both also had difficult journeys to motherhood. And now that they’re writing down their stories for Stella’s unborn child, the truth about their family is becoming harder to conceal. And while you can’t choose your family, you can choose what you tell them…<br><br>_________________________<br><br>Previously published as YOU GET THAT FROM ME<br><br>‘A delight… Her wry humour can induce proper snort-laughs’ THE TIMES<br><br>‘A beautifully crafted novel, spanning three generations of women whose stories and secrets are sure to steal your heart’ HOLLY MILLER<br><br>‘An absolute page-turner’ SHEILA McCLURE<br><br>‘Heartwarming’ HEAT<br><br>_________________________<br><br>Readers love The Family Fix!<br><br>‘You’ll find yourself laughing and smiling, shouting and crying’<br><br>‘This is the perfect book!’<br><br>‘A page-turning novel…about motherhood, love and all that life throws at us’<b